WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.600
[Upbeat indie pop music; soft paper flicks]

00:04.600 --> 00:09.400
[A soft whoosh, a pop, and light taps]

00:09.400 --> 00:14.400
[Two gentle pops as the choices appear]

00:14.400 --> 00:20.200
[A reference lands with a tap and chime]

00:20.200 --> 00:25.500
[Typing taps, then a bright search chime]

00:25.500 --> 00:31.600
[A warm reminder bell rings]

00:31.600 --> 00:38.000
[Thoughts sweep together; music resolves]
